@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #eef2f7
skinparam StateBorderColor #666666
title AR Arbiter FSM (per slave) -- round-robin with grant locking

[*] --> IDLE
IDLE : entry / ar_grant_matrix[s] = 0
IDLE : entry / ar_grant_active[s] = 0
IDLE : monitor ar_request_matrix[s]
IDLE : track priority via ar_last_grant[s]

GRANT_ACTIVE : entry / ar_grant_matrix[s][m] = 1
GRANT_ACTIVE : entry / ar_grant_active[s] = 1
GRANT_ACTIVE : hold grant until ARVALID && ARREADY
GRANT_ACTIVE : R data return follows the AR grant

IDLE --> GRANT_ACTIVE : any master requests\n(round-robin picks winner m)
GRANT_ACTIVE --> IDLE : AR handshake completes\nupdate ar_last_grant[s] = m
GRANT_ACTIVE --> GRANT_ACTIVE : handshake not yet complete\n(grant is LOCKED)

note right of GRANT_ACTIVE
  R responses are routed by the
  ID table, NOT by this grant.
end note
@enduml
